+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+The project's recorded decision for the transport compression codec is **zstd**, adopted after benchmarks showed it outperforming the codec previously in use. This value was last confirmed in the project's decision configuration and has not been superseded by any later decision, so it remains the current standard for transport compression.
